WwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-04-08T16:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T15:12:42Z","closed_at":"2026-04-11T15:12:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) UHD Graphics (CML GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10850H CPU @ 2.70GHz (12 threads) - 30.97 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn a GDScript extending any kind of Object, Godot will crash if you call the method `free` without using the `self` keyword, but only if it is exported without debug.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a simple node scene.\n- Create a GDScript on the root node.\n- In the script under `_ready` enter the line `free.call_deferred()`.\n- Export the project WITHOUT DEBUG.\n- View the most recent log in user data to confirm it could not identify `free` in the current scope.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo MRP.","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/us